                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game has a good ideea. But that's it. \nIt is far from finished.\n\nPro: Rare type of game that merges shooters with rts . \n       Looks very mod-able\n\nCons: Lots of invisible textures - when you go near a ramp you might get stuck or just get randomly thrown up.\n          The AI is very basic. You can just sit in the back of a base and the enemy AI will just ignore you.\n          The shooting is.. weird. The AI controlled Buggy can shoot while running. You can only shoot straight(minigun).\n          The menu and overall game controls are definetly made and kept for a controller. The only transition are the keybindings.\n          Very few upgrades, that don't look like they might impact the game a lot even in the late levels. (didn't reach there tho)\n         \n          Even if this game would be better, 10$? really? 2$ might be too much. 0.5$ maximum for it's current state.\n \n          Do not purchase this, some alpha state games are more complete than this. Even EA games have more content.",
